# Intentionally empty.
#
# 2026-08-22: tested whether one.com processes .htaccess on this account.
# A probe rewrite (^htaccess-probe$) returned 404, so mod_rewrite rules in
# .htaccess are NOT applied here -- AllowOverride is off. Any directives
# placed in this file are silently ignored; do not assume they work.
#
# Consequence: we cannot do content negotiation, so we cannot return
# Markdown when a request carries "Accept: text/markdown". The AI
# readiness check for that will keep failing on this hosting.
#
# The Markdown twins still work as a fallback: every page has a .md twin
# served as Content-Type: text/markdown, linked from the HTML with
# <link rel="alternate" type="text/markdown">. Regenerate them with
# tools-build-markdown.py after any content change.
